# Email-code MFA, lockout and password reset (ticket 05). Codes and links land in Mailpit:
# http://localhost:8025. Log in first with http/auth.http for the Bearer token.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken = paste-access-token
@email = you@example.com
@password = your-password
@mfaToken = paste-mfaToken-from-login
@code = 123456
@resetToken = paste-token-from-reset-link

### Turn MFA on (verified email required). Returns your profile with mfaEnabled: true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/mfa
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Log in. With MFA on the answer is { mfaRequired: true, mfaToken, expiresIn } and a code is emailed.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Second step: the code. Returns tokens and sets the refresh cookie, like a normal login.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login/mfa
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mfaToken": "{{mfaToken}}", "code": "{{code}}" }

### Email a new code for the same login attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login/mfa/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mfaToken": "{{mfaToken}}" }

### Turning MFA off needs a current code: ask for one...
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/mfa/disable-code
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ...then send it
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/mfa/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{code}}" }

# Lockout: 5 wrong passwords or codes within 15 minutes and login answers 429 for 15 minutes,
# even with the right password. Send the login above with a wrong password 5 times to see it.

### Password reset 1/3: email a reset link (same answer for unknown emails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/password-reset
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}" }

### 2/3: with the token from the link (after #token=), email a fresh code
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/password-reset/code
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{resetToken}}" }

### 3/3: token, code and new password. Every refresh token the User holds stops working.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/password-reset/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{resetToken}}", "code": "{{code}}", "password": "a brand new password" }
